- 命令: {"tool": "sandbox_python_exec", "purpose": "尝试对还原的二进制流进行比特反转（Bit Reversal），以修正潜在的字节序或位序问题，从而恢复可读的Flag。", "arguments": {"code": "import struct\n\n# 1. 读取输出数据\ntry:\n    with open('/home/gem/workspace/attachments/output.txt', 'r') as f:\n        lines = f.readlines()\nexcept FileNotFoundError:\n    print(\"文件未找到\")\n    exit()\n\noutput_nums = [int(line.strip()) for line in lines if line.strip()]\n\n# 2. 配置参数\nBLOCKS_COUNT = len(output_nums)\n\n# 3. 生成种子和随机数\nseeds = [(i * 127) % 500 for i in range(1, BLOCKS_COUNT + 1)]\nrandoms = [(((i * 327) % 681) + 344) % 313 for i in range(1, BLOCKS_COUNT + 1)]\n\n# 4. 还原 fun 值\nfuns = []\nprev_output = 0\nfor i in range(BLOCKS_COUNT):\n    fun = output_nums[i] ^ prev_output ^ randoms[i]\n    funs.append(fun)\n    prev_output = output_nums[i]\n\n# 5. 定义逆向 Scramble 函数\ndef reverse_scramble_to_raw(fun, seed):\n    fun_bin = bin(fun)[2:].zfill(60)\n    occupied = [False] * 30\n    P = []\n    for i in range(30):\n        y = (i * seed) % 30\n        while occupied[y]: y = (y + 1) % 30\n        occupied[y] = True\n        P.append(y)\n    raw = [''] * 30\n    for i in range(30):\n        pos = P[i]\n        val_pair = fun_bin[2*pos : 2*pos+2]\n        raw[i] = '0' if val_pair == '00' else '1'\n    return ''.join(raw)\n\n# 6. 构建完整的二进制流\nfinal_binary_stream = \"\"\nfor i in range(BLOCKS_COUNT):\n    raw = reverse_scramble_to_raw(funs[i], seeds[i])\n    final_binary_stream += raw\n\n# 7. 尝试解码 - 标准与字节反转\n# 由于之前的结果是乱码，可能是字节内的位序反了（LSB/MSB）\n\ndef decode_hex(stream):\n    # 尝试将二进制流转换为十六进制字符串，观察是否有规律\n    hex_str = \"\"\n    for i in range(0, len(stream), 8):\n        byte_str = stream[i:i+8]\n        if len(byte_str) == 8:\n            hex_str += format(int(byte_str, 2), '02x')\n    return hex_str\n\ndef decode_ascii(stream, reverse_bits=False):\n    res = \"\"\n    for i in range(0, len(stream), 8):\n        byte_str = stream[i:i+8]\n        if len(byte_str) == 8:\n            if reverse_bits:\n                byte_str = byte_str[::-1]\n            val = int(byte_str, 2)\n            if 32 <= val <= 126:\n                res += chr(val)\n            else:\n                res += '.'\n    return res\n\n# 尝试 1: 标准解码\nres_std = decode_ascii(final_binary_stream)\nprint(\"Standard ASCII (head):\", res_std[:200])\n\n# 尝试 2: 反转每个字节的位 (LSB First)\nres_rev_bits = decode_ascii(final_binary_stream, reverse_bits=True)\nprint(\"Reversed Bits ASCII (head):\", res_rev_bits[:200])\n\n# 尝试 3: 反转整个流的位顺序 (整流反转)\nreversed_stream = final_binary_stream[::-1]\nres_rev_stream = decode_ascii(reversed_stream)\nprint(\"Reversed Stream ASCII (head):\", res_rev_stream[:200])\n\n# 尝试 4: 检查十六进制\nhex_out = decode_hex(final_binary_stream)\nprint(\"Hex Output (head):\", hex_out[:100])\n\n# 尝试 5: 检查是否是加密的标志，尝试 XOR 0xFF 或其他简单变换\n# 也尝试将二进制流视为字节流并直接转换（处理不可打印字符）\nraw_bytes = bytes([int(final_binary_stream[i:i+8], 2) for i in range(0, len(final_binary_stream), 8)])\nprint(\"Raw bytes (first 20):\", raw_bytes[:20])\n\n# 查找 flag\nfor name, s in [(\"Standard\", res_std), (\"RevBits\", res_rev_bits), (\"RevStream\", res_rev_stream)]:\n    if \"flag\" in s.lower() or \"{\" in s:\n        print(f\"\\n*** POTENTIAL FLAG IN {name} ***\")\n        print(s[:500])\n"}}
